<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>App Dev Event Invitation - {{eventName}}</title>
</head>
{{> header}}

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;">
    <p>Hey {{inviteeName}},<br>You've been invited to attend the <b>{{eventName}}</b> event on <b>{{startTime}}</b>. 
    </p>
    <p>Below are the details for the event: </p>
    <ul>
        <li><b>Event Name:</b> {{eventName}}</li>
        <li><b>Description:</b> {{eventDescription}}</li>
        <li><b>Start Time:</b> {{startTime}}</li>
        <li><b>End Time:</b> {{endTime}}</li>
        <li><b>Location:</b> {{eventLocation}}</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Please let us know if you are able or unable to attend ASAP. We've generated a unique link for you to 
        RSVP for this event. Again, please RSVP ASAP in order for us to plan for your attendance.
    </p>
    <p>RSVP here: <a href="#">Click me</a></p> <!-- TODO -->
    <a href="{{googleCalendarLink}}">Add to Google Calendar</a>
    <p>We hope to see you there!</p>
</body>
{{> footer}}

</html>